<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill starts car after-market cos.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill starts car after-market cos.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it initiated coverage of automotive after-market companies.</p>
<p>-- said started O'Reilly Automotive Inc as an intermediate and long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- started Federal-Mogul Corp as an intermediate-term accumulate, long-term buy.</p>
<p>-- started Echlin Inc as intermediate, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- started Snap-On Inc as intermediate, long-term accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
